# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Data (large / external) — NOT tracked
#   46GB of preprocessed NIfTI images + external metadata live under data/.
#   We ignore data/ wholesale, then re-include ONLY the small, reproducible
#   split definitions (notebooks + CSVs + README) which are the paper's
#   "single source of truth". To re-include a file under an ignored dir, every
#   parent directory must be un-ignored first — hence the ladder below.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/data/*
!/data/preprocessed/
/data/preprocessed/*
!/data/preprocessed/v1.0.0/
/data/preprocessed/v1.0.0/*
!/data/preprocessed/v1.0.0/_global/
/data/preprocessed/v1.0.0/_global/*
!/data/preprocessed/v1.0.0/_global/splits/
# inside splits/: keep notebooks, CSVs, README; ignore checkpoints/scratch
/data/preprocessed/v1.0.0/_global/splits/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Model weights / checkpoints / large binary artifacts — NOT tracked
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.pb
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.tflite
*.bin
*.npz
*.npy
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.joblib
checkpoints/
weights/
runs/
outputs/
logs/
wandb/
mlruns/
lightning_logs/
*.log

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Python / uv
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.python-version
# uv.lock IS committed (reproducible env) — do not ignore it.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets / certs (Tailscale node cert+key live at repo root) — NEVER track
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.key
*.crt
*.pem
spark-*.ts.net.*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Session / scratch — NOT tracked
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/scratchpad/
.claude-memory/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS / editor junk
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.env
